nt\n        - then:\n            - I receive a message telling me Claude only read part of it\n\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation Question\n\nDoes the story follow the format\n\"As a [type of user], I want [some goal] so that [some reason]\"?\n\nPass when all three clauses (as_a, i_want, so_that) are present\nand the statement reads as a coherent user story.\nFail when any clause is missing or the format is not recognizable.\n\nContext: emit a single line per clause.\n  - \"as_a: present — '\u003cquoted role\u003e'\"\n  - \"i_want: present — '\u003cshort summary\u003e'\"\n  - \"so_that: present — '\u003cshort summary\u003e'\"\n  or\n  - \"\u003cclause\u003e: missing\"\n SO THAT WE ENSURE Standard user story format ensures clarity and consistency.\n\n## Answer Format\nOutput your answer using this exact format:\n\n=== FILE_START: tmp/2026-08-15-18-06-17-76507/01-99.1-checklist-us-create-format-result.yaml ===\nanswer: \u003cpass | fail\u003e\ncontext:\n  - \"\u003cone observation per line\u003e\"\n=== FILE_END: tmp/2026-08-15-18-06-17-76507/01-99.1-checklist-us-create-format-result.yaml ===\n","role":"user"},"session_id":"default"}
